               <code code="42232-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="PRECAUTIONS SECTION"/>
               <title>HOW SUPPLIED:</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Prodigen is supplied as clear capsules dispensed in HDPE plastic bottles of 30ct.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>69336-402-30</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Reserved for Professional Recommendation<br/>All prescriptions using this product shall be pursuant to state statutes as applicable. This is not an Orange Book product. This product may be administered only under a physician’s supervision. There are no implied or explicit claims on therapeutic equivalence.<br/>Manufactured for:<br/>Sterling-Knight Pharmaceuticals, LLC<br/>Ripley, MS 38663</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Item 40230<br/>Rev. 0418-1</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180427"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="L67d23ee4-2fce-4e65-b19e-7cb3cdfa02fc">
               <id root="f0dace7e-049a-438f-b020-85ae19a03a77"/>
               <code code="50741-8" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="SAFE HANDLING WARNING SECTION"/>
               <title>STORAGE:</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Store at controlled room temperature 15°-30°C (59°F-86°F). Keep in cool dry place. Call your doctor about side effects. You may report side effects to FDA at 1-800-FDA-1088.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>KEEP THIS OUT OF THE REACH OF CHILDREN.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180427"/>
            </section>
